10
00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:31.348
1.

11
00:00:31.628 --> 00:00:45.879
A national railway reservation system in the IRCTC style: the train inventory model (seats by segment along a route, quotas, classes);. berth allocation, waitlists and RAC;. charting, cancellations and refunds;.

12
00:00:47.229 --> 00:00:56.018
the Tatkal rush, when a large share of the day's demand arrives in the first minutes after the window opens;. bots and agents, payments at peak.

13
00:00:56.298 --> 00:00:57.002
2.

14
00:00:57.282 --> 00:01:10.999
An online travel agency (OTA) for flights and buses: flight search across airlines through GDS and NDC connections;. fare caching and the look-to-book problem;. booking and ticketing, schedule changes;.

15
00:01:12.349 --> 00:01:14.099
bus aggregator inventory.

16
00:01:14.379 --> 00:01:30.677
Also covered: the algorithms: segment inventory with bitsets, berth allocation, waitlist confirmation prediction, fare caching and invalidation, admission control, bot detection, dynamic fares, demand forecasting;. the data platform and tech stack.

17
00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:31.939
Reading time:

18
00:01:32.219 --> 00:01:33.371
85 min.

19
